  - m_Id: 6149596439965696
    m_Key: 'Three asteroid field campaigns: split asteroids, dodge mines, comets and black holes, fight saucers, wasps and bosses, upgrade your guns, then see how long you last in the endless Deep Field. Then take the war to the planets in three Planet Strike campaigns of vertical scrolling air and ground combat, with a Supply Room to spend your earnings in and a boss at the end of every mission. Co-op for up to four pilots.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6149596507074560
    m_Key: The Raider War
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6149596507074561
    m_Key: 'Four sectors, twelve missions: break the raiders'' hold on the Kepler Belt and hunt their Dreadnought into the Void Core.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6149596507074562
    m_Key: Shadow Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6149596507074563
    m_Key: 'Nine missions over three worlds: take the war down to the Shadow''s planets and end it at the Shadow Station.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6149596507074564
    m_Key: CAMPAIGN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
