  - m_Id: 6164095725268999
    m_Key: Phase Rounds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269000
    m_Key: Aegis Barrier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269001
    m_Key: Every shot passes through two more targets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269002
    m_Key: Nothing gets through your shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269003
    m_Key: FK-7 Hailstorm Flak Cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269004
    m_Key: Shells that burst into shrapnel when aircraft come close. Air only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269005
    m_Key: CBU-24 Scatterfall Cluster Bombs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269006
    m_Key: A canister that scatters six bomblets over the ground. Ground only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269007
    m_Key: NP-4 Inferno Napalm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269008
    m_Key: Canisters that set the ground ablaze for three seconds. Ground only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269009
    m_Key: SR-12 Locust Swarm Rockets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269010
    m_Key: Six small rockets that find their own targets. Air and ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269011
    m_Key: ZX-5 Tempest Arc Lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269012
    m_Key: A spark whose lightning jumps to four more targets. Air and ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269013
    m_Key: HV-88 Vindicator Rail Gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269014
    m_Key: A slug that goes through everything in its line. Air and ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269015
    m_Key: Ceramite Armor Plating
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269016
    m_Key: Each plate takes 10% off every hit. Up to three.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269017
    m_Key: MR-2 Nanite Repair Drone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269018
    m_Key: Repairs 1 energy every 2.5 seconds, firing or not, on every difficulty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269019
    m_Key: AB-6 Afterburner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269020
    m_Key: The ship flies 15% faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269021
    m_Key: Salvage Magnet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6164095725269022
    m_Key: Pickups and credits drift to the ship from far away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
